// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1556617275" "Thanks!  Just one more picture!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
