// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_CORPSPRGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1350237706" "Take care of yourself!"



// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1085676710" "Did you never learn that the good guys win?"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P816853202" "Atlas Park needs a few less of you guys!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3054943259" "You're in trouble now!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4240437476" "Atlas Park has been dealing with you scum for TOO LONG!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P215791882" "You guys just NEVER learn."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1667454549" "Hero!  Move it!  Give us a hand here!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3185894545" "Don't just stand there, hero!  Get in the fight!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2851676218" "Let's move, hero!  Give us a hand!"

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P85743195" "Not again!  You took my purse last week!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P400783998" "You have got to be kidding me!  I just replaced my last purse!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2264990470" "There is nothing inside!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1102208263" "Why must we do this DAY after DAY???"

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1995801268" "You gonna let him get away with that?!  Go after him!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P475868204" "Don't just stand there!  Go!  I'm heading to the Plaza!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P769898959" "Well don't just stand there!  Get him!"

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2471282197" "So let me get this straight: you struggled back and forth, he took the purse, you fell down, and then he ran away."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2784852255" "So you say this is the same fellow who stole your purse last week, hm?"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4251492800" "Stole it right on the street corner.  I see.  Okay, I'll look into it."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2750126816" "Where were YOU, hero, when her purse was being stolen?"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2196453526" "Well I'm glad you're safe.  We'll look into it."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1364474533" "That must have been very traumatic for you.  I'll get right on it."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_ASSISTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P56288198" "Thank you so much.  You've been such a help.  I am so proud to live here in Galaxy City."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_ASSISTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2287135608" "Oh thank you.  You've been so helpful."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_ASSISTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2743338405" "Thank you.  I'm grateful to the Freedom Corps."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_ASSISTED_FCHELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3320143712" "If there is anything else you need, please do not hesitate to ask."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_ASSISTED_FCHELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P832403570" "It's my pleasure to help."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_ASSISTED_FCHELPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P435133848" "Of course.  Is there anything else you need?"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_ASSISTED_FCHELPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P654569694" "Get to safety!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_ASSISTED_FCHELPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1857401089" "I'll take care of this!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_ASSISTED_FCHELPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P693273878" "Quick.  Get to safety!  I'll handle this!"


// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P142587636" "Mayhem on every street corner.  Keep alert, squad."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1634177985" "Maintain patrol around this structure."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1727627970" "If it is bad and it moves, attack it, then continue on the patrol.  That's the order."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P249993822" "Stick together!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1190096084" "You know what to do, squad!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1880175979" "I love Galaxy City.  The perfect subject for my photo study."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2361736971" "Just one more photograph."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1456221891" "Oh, now this is going to be quite a picture."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFC_HAPPYFLEE_TEXT :
"P3032192668" "Whee!  I'm going to get these printed right this minute!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFC_HAPPYFLEE_TEXT :
"P1987876904" "I'm a genius!  That journalism instructor is going to LOVE my piece!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFC_HAPPYFLEE_TEXT :
"P1376733116" "I am going to make so much money in postcards on these images!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_CORPSPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1398184724" "Cheese!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_CORPSPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3394316796" "Another?  Sure."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_CORPSPRGUY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3540448815" "Big smile?  Sure."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_CORPSPRGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3924592297" "Get inside!  I'll take care of this!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_CORPSPRGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4287127625" "Quickly!  Inside!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_CORPSPRGUY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3816766464" "Go!  Now!  I'll handle this!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1862218917" "Just one more?  These are great!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3101224664" "My friends are not going to believe this!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_NPC_PHOTOOPFREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3492839299" "That's super!  Just one more?"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_FREEDOMCORPSPR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2630727816" "If there's anything else you need, just ask."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_PHOTOOP_FREEDOMCORPSPR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3518124750" "It would be my pleasure."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4167460202" "Keep Galaxy City safe!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3338318790" "Failure is not an option, squad!  Galaxy City must be protected!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3343311831" "You are a blight on this city!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1635620630" "Don't just stand there, hero!  Get over here!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3504899128" "Heroes!  Come on!  Let's go!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3071769066" "Yes.  It's black.  He practically ripped my arms out of their sockets."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2955969931" "Well, it's not the first time this has happened, you know."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P417836696" "It's getting so bad these days!  A purse snatcher on practically every street corner!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1115584709" "Well, this obviously must stop!  I've had my purse stolen many times!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P397604325" "Well, I'm going to my martial arts class!  I'm taking matters into my own hands."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2038117068" "Well, I trust you'll do something about it.  I'm off to report this and get it on record."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_NPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1394951422" "They're all hooligans, you know.  I barely keep anything in my purse anymore.  I've gone through three this week!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2881869867" "I see.  Well that must have been very frightening for you.  The purse was black, you say?"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1109416455" "Right.  So what did the man look like?  Red bandana?  Yes, we've had complaints about them before."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P89870737" "Got it.  Is there anything else you can think of?  The more detail the better."

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3527452342" "Off you go!  I'll take care of this."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_STOLENPURSE_FREEDOMCORPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P969871565" "Quickly!  To safety!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2639329279" "We need to keep the punks of Kings Row on alert."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P188658703" "Sheesh.  Kings Row is infested with punks."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1548746583" "Should be an interesting day."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1916660419" "Watch out!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2260604058" "We got unfriendlies!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P832520016" "Careful!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PARAGONPOLICE_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1447831709" "You have our help."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PARAGONPOLICE_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2579935520" "We're on it."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PARAGONPOLICE_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1984987240" "Agreed."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PARAGONPOLICE_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4075691960" "We'll stick to the streets, you maintain a strong presence in the key locations."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PARAGONPOLICE_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1284966209" "Kings Row is infested.  I think between your squad and ours, we'll get this place on track."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PARAGONPOLICE_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P272805635" "I've seen some Dyne deals going on lately.  Keep an eye out."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PARAGONPOLICE_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2020935804" "I've seen a few more Trolls around lately.  Keep an eye out.  I know they're dealing again."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1184602449" "That's a good plan."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1065466720" "I agree."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P877718368" "Well put."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3906214048" "Hey!  We got company!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1923792157" "Watch yourself!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_FREEDOM_CHATTERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2163336061" "There!"


// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2839501852" "We've got several villains around here to watch out for.  Everyone keep on alert."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P219257064" "Pay careful attention to the alleys and dark corners.  They're everywhere."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1653485584" "Circle of Thorns are getting pretty bold.  Keep an eye on them."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3569583464" "Over there!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2070363263" "Sir!  There!"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3340323779" "Hm.  I see something."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1021910287" "I see trouble in the distance."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3645859200" "Ah, there.  Trouble."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3262713821" "Right.  I see it.  Trouble with a capital 'T'."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1724972398" "Sigh.  Is anyone surprised that I see trouble?"

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P166966003" "Time to move!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_ALERT_TEXT :
