// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1747483393" "Time to do some cleaning!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_PERCH_BINOCULARS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2442083264" "Okay, time to clean up this section of Kings Row."

// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_ASSISTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2408808089" "Thanks very much.  I appreciate the help."
// FAULTLINE_NEWOVERBROOK_NPC_ASSISTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1976982191" "Thank you so much.  You've been such a help."



