// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMFREAKSHOW_FREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3246170368" "We refuse to let you get away with this!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMFREAKSHOW_FREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1576184763" "Oh shut up, you little crying girl!  Just fight and quit whimpering!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMFREAKSHOW_FREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P927932020" "I don't care if I go down, I just want to make sure you come with me!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMFREAKSHOW_FREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4256925431" "But we're having so much FUN!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMLOST_FREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3852328939" "This can only end badly for you guys!  You need to give up!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMLOST_FREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P992001735" "Are you crazy?!  Surrender!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMLOST_FREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P91569744" "What are you doing?  You have never been this aggressive before!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMLOST_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P726381650" "The tides are changing!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMLOST_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4200256932" "Your time is coming to and end!  Ours is just beginning!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_FREEDOMLOST_LOST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3683199555" "You have NO idea, do you?  NO idea!"


// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3046990549" "Overflow is crawling with Arachnos, especially the docks."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1651178765" "There's fighting for territory on both sides of the water by Freakshow and Lost.  Sure.  I'll keep you updated."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1111238062" "We are hugely outnumbered here.  If you have any extra reinforcements, we could use use them."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1843113804" "We've got air patrols out now.  Sure, I'll report back in twenty minutes."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P692924069" "Not on my watch, villain!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P141464312" "You're not going to get away with this!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P922112894" "We've got bogeys!"

// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_CHAT_TEXT :
"P2992631897" "Well, the diagnostics report all systems optimal, but we're going to send out a few units just to check on it anyway."
// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_CHAT_TEXT :
"P1420409138" "Hey, do you want to head over to the Rusty Rivet after shift?  I haven't been to that pub in forever."
// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_CHAT_TEXT :
"P3049862118" "Between Arachnos and the Sky Raiders, that reservoir is a constant bed of activity.  I just wish we had more presence out there."
// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_CHAT_TEXT :
"P1958363022" "What's your plans for tonight?  I think I may head over to Bianco's later.  I'm in the mood for pasta."
// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_CHAT_TEXT :
"P746570609" "I just got on shift.  What's up today?"
// FAULTLINE_TURBINEROOM_CHAT_TEXT :
"P136729656" "It's pretty crazy out there what with that Arachnos base right next to us."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_HUMANFLYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1975823253" "This neighborhood is ripe for a situation.  Send in some Vanguard troops."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_HUMANFLYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4147180836" "Man!  I can see the Rikti ship from up here!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_HUMANFLYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P299824163" "Whoa.  Base, I'm heading back in a few.  There's a lot of activity down there."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_HUMANFLYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3273739503" "Send reinforcements!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_HUMANFLYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1962062849" "Notify Vanguard, I need help NOW!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4176712411" "Base, this is Eagle 2.  I'm heading your way.  Over."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1194904695" "I'm going to make another pass before I head back to the base.  I'll let you know if anything comes up."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2523372838" "I'm getting low on fuel.  Heading back to base soon."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2774325549" "I'm engaging the enemy!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P687075167" "Send in some Vanguard ground troops!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_AIRPATROL_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2465182162" "I'm hit!"

// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2098137630" "I'm not happy that Vanguard is running the show any more than you are.  But orders are orders."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P778299501" "Keep the base secure topside.  Easy to say from down below."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3204899750" "I hear you.  It goes against everything I know not arresting those villains.  Orders are orders.  We just deal with it."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1386889531" "Shhh.  Opinions like that could get you fired.  They're here.  Make the best of it.  We need all the help we can get."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P623831257" "I wonder what kind of major tension is going on with the higher ups.  I sense major tension with the Vanguard."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2884579678" "Talk about an uneasy alliance.  Just keep your head down and do your job.  Personal opinions have no place here."

// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1460603611" "Did you see that?!"
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P774898018" "Over here!  Quick!"
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P502872868" "We've got trouble!"
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_D1_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P123167550" "Get ready!"


// RWZ_BULGE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1391103237" "Sir!  We have trouble in The Bulge!  Request reinforcements!"
// RWZ_BULGE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3897765281" "We've got some action over here!"

// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1766476830" "Look.  We keep it simple.  Whatever issues you guys have with us, they don't make it topside.  Got me?"
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P552375811" "There is a lot at stake here.  We don't have time for personality conflicts.  Got me?  You guys need to help set the example."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P518607005" "We have a potentially explosive situation here.  Heroes and Villains working together is a recipe for disaster. If Longbow and Vanguard can't put aside the power struggles and set the example, then this whole thing is going to detonate."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1256649633" "I understand what Ms. Liberty would prefer.  I understand what the whole Phalanx would prefer.  It's not your show here.  It's ours.  Deal with it."

// RWZ_VANGUARDCOMPOUND_TALK_FCVANGUARD_VANGUARDTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2173496584" "Fight now.  Discuss later!"
// RWZ_VANGUARDCOMPOUND_TALK_FCVANGUARD_VANGUARDTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2657685591" "Come on, Longbow, let's go!"

// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3946442013" "I'm not any happier than you are about it."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4173645120" "We'll figure it out."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3523141374" "I'm just following orders."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P455508760" "At this point, the Rikti is my focus.  Not some internal struggle between our two camps."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1497229863" "Let's just keep our eye on the prize.  Keep the site under control."
// RWZ_VANGUARDBASE_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1599956087" "You're not telling me anything I don't know already."

// RWZ_VANGUARDCOMPOUND_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P130829014" "I got your back!"
// RWZ_VANGUARDCOMPOUND_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1229073260" "With you!"
// RWZ_VANGUARDCOMPOUND_TALK_FCVANGUARD_FCTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4083564014" "Let's do it!"

// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCHAT_LEFT :
"P2106557118" "Well it's good to hear that we're actually making a difference."
// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCHAT_LEFT :
"P2615031740" "I think we've come a long way since the Rikti Invasion."
// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCHAT_LEFT :
"P2432194844" "With people like you around, Paragon City will be all the safer."

// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER :
"P2381712549" "This months' analysis showed a decrease in Arachnos activity."
// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER :
"P2921284396" "I hear that crimes rates have been dropping lately."
// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER :
"P3758589928" "It's nice to be able to relax for a moment here and there."

// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_CELLPHONE_CHAT :
"P918816144" "Nah, I don't need to do overtime today.  We've got some good heroes on the job."
// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_CELLPHONE_CHAT :
"P888532345" "I'd like twelve pepperonis, please.  And, uh, your flyer said you deliver anywhere..."
// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_CELLPHONE_CHAT :
"P3933122060" "Ummm... No, that wasn't me on the news!  Why would an accountant be on the news?<em t=3> Sheesh!  You worry to much, Mom!"

// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCOFFEE_COFFEEDRINKER_CHAT :
"P772025470" "So then I said, 'That better not be a quadrohydronic inducer I see in your hands, Aeon'..."
// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCOFFEE_COFFEEDRINKER_CHAT :
