// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCOFFEE_COFFEEDRINKER_CHAT :
"P1979935782" "Did you hear that Susie Johnson from Dimensional Monitoring actually spotted six separate anomalies this week alone?"

// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCOFFEE_DONUTEATER_CHAT :
"P725537840" "I really should take more breaks to catch up on the gossip."
// HEROLOUNGE_FREEDOMCORPS_DUOCOFFEE_DONUTEATER_CHAT :
